// ---- Dragon names ----
// A name is: [honorific] stem [numeral] + epithet. Size "band" 0/1/2 (newt / cart / barn) is
// drawn from the dragon's index with some bleed, so early epithets are earnest and ankle-high and
// later ones get grand. Mismatches ("Doom of Toes", "Wee Vexathrax") are a feature.
// Epithet join rule: an epithet that starts with "," (", Who...", ", Bane of...") attaches with no
// space; anything else attaches with one space. An empty epithet means the name stands alone.

type Band = readonly [readonly string[], readonly string[], readonly string[]];

